 r←Test_Init_93(debugFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;T2;rc;log
⍝ Exercise `Run` with a monadic `Initial_Foo` that returns no result: the members of "Foo" must be executed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
